{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i><strong>Old Fairy</strong></i>\u00a0an often forgotten about planet that never provided much intrigue... Until now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&lt; OVERVIEW &gt;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SImply Unstable is a puzzle platformer where you make modifications to the environment around you to help solve puzzle and platforming dilemmas. Every object has multiple effects that can be utilized to overcome challenges so don't be afraid to really experiment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&lt; FEATURES &gt;</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 40 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many items with multiple stages of unstability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple bosses that mix platform + puzzle elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many secrets!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3504330?t=1763100612","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504330/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763100612","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504330/3a97878db20978e7520df5e00d0411ca88ddc13d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763100612","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3504330/3a97878db20978e7520df5e00d0411ca88ddc13d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763100612","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i><strong>Old Fairy<